{
	"_about": "maple: a 30s vector-construction launch film for a design / logo AI, derived frame-by-frame from the QuiverAI Arrow 1.0 launch film (@joanrod_ai on X, 2026-02-25; 30.0s, 1920x1080 @60fps, rebuilt on a 30fps clock). Authored on the 1280x720 stage (stage px = reference px / 1.5) and rendered at device scale 1.5 for 1920x1080: render.mjs --fps 30 --scale 1.5. Placeholder product: Maple (maple.example), whose model Samara turns a sketch into a clean, editable vector mark. The hero mark (MapleMark), the brand logo (MapleLogo), cards, chrome and wordmarks are drawn; copy is role-tagged; the sketch photo and eight mockup photos are labelled image slots.",
	"_sections": "S1 sketch photo pull-back into a canvas window, blue trace + SVG code drift, comet outline on black, ink outline on an iso grid 0-4.033 | S2 wireframe close-up with anchor dots and fillets, node mark + cursor, navy fill, hatch sweep, gradient fill + hue-slider scrub 4.033-8.967 | S3 full-bleed gradient + resize selection, shrink to an app-icon tile, typed prompt with a caret-tracking pan, send-button click and whip 8.967-13.8 | S4 white-to-black fade, gradient card rise and three rolodex flips, the mark dragged out of the card and dropped 13.8-17.033 | S5 eight-cut mockup montage, prompt card on a dot grid, outline 'lorem' wordmark, font flash 17.033-23.033 | S6 lockup grows with selection box and guides, collapses to the logo, url types on, cut to black at 29.633 23.033-30",
	"_slots": "9 image slots: 'sketch-photo' (s1-sketch-canvas: set photo 'slot' and src, else a drawn pencil sketch stands in) and 'mockup-1'..'mockup-8' (s5-mockups: srcs {slot: path}; labels and strings per slot). The variation mark and the mockup strings are composited over each photo.",
